      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_41",
        on: "sighted",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "filter_condition",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "predicate",
                name: "wml_filter",
                unit: "$last_sighted_id",
                filter: "%7B%22tag%22%3A%22filter%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22side%22%3A%224%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D",
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "filter_condition",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "predicate",
                name: "wml_filter",
                unit: "$last_seer_id",
                filter: "%7B%22tag%22%3A%22filter_second%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22side%22%3A%221%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D",
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("Stand where ye be, you... Och! A human!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Tallin",
            text: _("Greetings from the people of Dwarven Doors, friend."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("Dwarven Doors? I thought ye surface humans had been enslaved or slain by the orcs years ago."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Tallin",
            text: _("Yes, we were enslaved, but we rose against Al’Tar and defeated his warband. In order to stay free, we seek help and equipment from our old allies, the dwarves."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("Och, the dwarves of Knalga are themselves in desperate straits — but we havena’ forgotten the old bonds. Be welcome to our keep. Aye, and have speech with our chieftain, the Lord Hamel."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Tallin",
            text: _("Very well."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:set_variable_dynamic",
            variable: "found_dwarves",
            value: "yes",
            mode: "value",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:show_objectives",
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_42",
        on: "moveto",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "filter_condition",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "predicate",
                name: "wml_filter",
                unit: "$unit_moved_id",
                filter: "%7B%22tag%22%3A%22filter%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22id%22%3A%22Tallin%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%7B%22tag%22%3A%22filter_location%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22radius%22%3A%225%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%7B%22tag%22%3A%22filter%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22id%22%3A%22Hamel%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D%2C%7B%22tag%22%3A%22filter_radius%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22terrain%22%3A%22!%2CX*%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D%5D%7D%5D%7D",
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Hamel",
            text: _("Well met, Tallin. My men have told me of your victory against Al’Tar."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Tallin",
            text: _("Thank you and well-met indeed, Lord Hamel. I must say, this place is interesting."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Hamel",
            text: _("This is how we get our food, me lad. Since we are a tad close to the surface here, some sunlight shines down through the cracks in the roof. If we baby the plants, we can usually get enough. They taste unco’ foul but that’s how we ha’ survived all these long years. But come, let us talk!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Supporter",
            text: _("Whew, we did it!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Camerin",
            text: _("Awww! Are we done already?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "win",
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "if_44",
        on: "branch_if_44",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "condition",
            variable: "found_dwarves",
            equals: "yes",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Tallin",
            text: _("Good, we managed to clear the caves... for now, anyway. Now let’s get to the dwarven keep and dicker for better weapons."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "if_45",
        on: "branch_if_45",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "condition",
            variable: "found_dwarves",
            not_equals: "yes",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Tallin",
            text: _("Good, there are no more monsters lurking in these parts of the tunnels. I think I can hear the clamor of dwarves just ahead. Come on men, let’s go meet them."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_43",
        on: "enemies_defeated",
        once: true,
        children: [
