            event: "branch_if_45",
          },
          {
            tag: "win",
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_46",
        on: "die",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "filter_condition",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "predicate",
                name: "wml_filter",
                unit: "$last_dead_id",
                filter: "%7B%22tag%22%3A%22filter%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22id%22%3A%22Hamel%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D",
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:play_music",
            file: "sad.ogg",
            play_once: "yes",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Messenger",
            text: _("Tallin, we have just received the news that the dwarvish Lord Hamel has just been slain. We are too late!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Tallin",
            text: _("No! Without the dwarvish weapons we have no hope!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "lose",
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "if_48",
        on: "branch_if_48",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "condition",
            variable: "found_Camerin",
            equals: "no",
          },
          {
            tag: "spawn",
            id: "Camerin",
            type: "Arch Mage",
            side: 1,
            x: 5,
            y: 10,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:spawn_unit",
            unit: "Camerin",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:make_loyal",
            unit: "Camerin",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Camerin",
            text: _("Hey, what’s going on in here?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Admirer",
            text: _("We are killing lots of trolls and skeletons."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Camerin",
            text: _("Really! Did you save any for me?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Admirer",
            text: _("Uh, not really..."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Camerin",
            text: _("Awww!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Admirer",
            text: _("But hey, if you want to join us, I am sure we will be fighting a lot more orcs, trolls and skeletons in the near future."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Camerin",
            text: _("Really! Oh yeah, I am in!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Tallin",
            text: _("... That was rather odd. Who is this guy?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Hamel",
            text: _("Oh, dinna’ mind him, that’d be Camerin. He used to be yer usual scholarly mage, and he moved awa’ up here to be alone and study. But then when the orcs invaded he went a little loony. My guess is that some roving orcs ransacked his place and burnt his notes or something. Whatever it was, he couldna’ take it and became fey. Ever since he has been roving these caves destroying any manner of monster that he comes across. They all give him a very wide berth by now. So just be polite, give him some room and you’ll find he is relatively harmless..."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_47",
        on: "victory",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:fire_event",
            event: "branch_if_48",
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_49",
        on: "time_over",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            text: _("Without eating or sleeping for days, Tallin’s men begin to fall one by one."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Tallin",
            text: _("We were too slow in finding the dwarves. I don’t think we can fight for much longer!"),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_50",
        on: "last_breath",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "filter_condition",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "predicate",
                name: "wml_filter",
                unit: "$last_dead_id",
                filter: "%7B%22tag%22%3A%22filter%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22id%22%3A%22Tallin%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D",
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:play_music",
            file: "sad.ogg",
            play_once: "yes",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Tallin",
            text: _("Argh! I am finished, but our campaign must... not end... crush... our... enemies... and... save... our... people..."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Supporter",
            text: _("No, Tallin, we can’t do it without you!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "lose",
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_51",
        on: "last_breath",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "filter_condition",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "predicate",
                name: "wml_filter",
                unit: "$last_dead_id",
                filter: "%7B%22tag%22%3A%22filter%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22id%22%3A%22Camerin%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D",
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:play_music",
            file: "sad.ogg",
            play_once: "yes",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Camerin",
            text: _("What... how can this happen?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Tallin",
            text: _("He was stark raving mad, but I am sure going to miss him."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_52",
        on: "die",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
